Brand name availability check per platform
title end

paragraph start
For every platform in the plan, search the exact name SHAPE and the faces SHAPESHIFTER and ARCHITECT, plus close spellings, before any account is made. Record what is taken, what is free and who holds near matches.
paragraph end

paragraph start
A name is clear only when the exact handle is free, no similar active account works in the same topic, and the same handle can be used everywhere. If not, pick one fallback handle pattern and keep it identical across platforms.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
platform, name searched, exact handle free, similar accounts, fallback handle, date checked
code end

